tion style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#3 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-06-05/03-liquidai-lfm2-5-8b-a1b.png\" alt=\"LiquidAI/LFM2.5-8B-A1B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">LiquidAI/LFM2.5-8B-A1B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">LiquidAI推出的LFM2.5-8B-A1B是一款基于创新架构构建的通用大语言模型，强调在较小参数规模下的逻辑处理能力和知识覆盖面。该模型旨在为开发者提供高效、灵活的推理选项，适用于各种自然语言理解、创意写作及自动化办公场景。其轻量化的设计使其能够较好地平衡计算开销与响应速度，便于在多种边缘设备上进行适配与部署。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#4 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-06-05/04-hauhaucs-qwen3-6-35b-a3b-uncensored-hauhaucs-aggressive.png\" alt=\"HauhauCS/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-Uncensored-HauhauCS-Aggressive\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">HauhauCS/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-Uncensored-HauhauCS-Aggressive</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-Uncensored-HauhauCS-Aggressive是由社区开发的一款基于Qwen架构的去审查模型。该模型移除了原始版本中的合规性限制，以实现更直接的响应。主要面向对内容审查有特殊需求的研发群体，适用于探索模型极限能力、进行学术研究或处理特定领域内的开放性对话任务，但使用者需自行承担内容生成的合规性风险。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#5 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-06-05/05-unsloth-gemma-4-12b-it-gguf.png\" alt=\"unsloth/gemma-4-12b-it-GGUF\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">unsloth/gemma-4-12b-it-GGUF</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">unsloth/gemma-4-12b-it-GGUF是针对Google Gemma-4-12B模型进行的GGUF格式量化版本。该模型由Unsloth框架优化，旨在通过量化技术显著降低显存占用并提升推理速度。通过GGUF格式，用户可以更便捷地在本地消费级硬